- Required paths `ReplicatedStorage.Assets.Vehicles.sm50.Frame`, `ReplicatedStorage.Assets.Parts.Part_<id>`, and `ReplicatedStorage.Assets.World.<name>`. See the adjacent manifests for exact names, material layers, pivots, and local attachments.
